<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3 </span>iOS Actions Dataset</h3>

<div id="A1.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We construct an iOS Actions Dataset derived from Apple’s Shortcuts framework to ground scenarios in realistic, executable device interactions. The dataset contains 303 distinct actions spanning seven functional domains (apps, documents, location, media, scripting, sharing, and web), covering common iOS capabilities such as calendar management, file operations, media control, automation logic, and system settings. Each action is represented with a standardized schema that enables consistent invocation, state updates, and evaluation within the Agent-as-a-World framework.</p>
</div>
<figure id="LST10" class="ltx_float ltx_lstlisting">
<div id="LST10.2" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_language_json ltx_lst_numbers_left ltx_lstlisting ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing" style="--ltx-bg-color:#EEEEEE;"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx772" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">1</span>
              
              
              
            <span id="lstnumberx772.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_literate ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#1469B0;">[</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx773" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">2</span>
              
              
              
            <span id="lstnumberx773.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter">  </span><span id="lstnumberx773.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{</span>
</div>
